<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM 1996/97 profit 236 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>KLM 1996/97 profit 236 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996/97 to end-March.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   236     vs  547</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)	    3.01  vs  5.86</p>
<p>    Dividend per share (guilders)	    1.00  vs  2.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected KLM Royal Dutch Airlines to report a full-year 1996/97 net profit from normal operations of 380-430 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Non-recurring provision		  290     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Operating result		    loss 201     vs  453 profit</p>
<p>    Traffic revenue (billions)		 9.03  vs    8.28</p>
<p>    Total turnover (billions)		 10.36  vs    9.54</p>
<p>    Interest charges			   215     vs  191</p>
<p>    Profit on asset sales		     15     vs   94</p>
<p>    Income from Northwest Airlines	 442     vs  258</p>
<p>    Income from other holdings		75     vs   62</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			     116     vs  676</p>
<p>    Tax				     gain 120     vs  130 charge</p>
<p>    Minority interests			 nil     vs    1</p>
<p>    Preferred stock dividends		 14     vs   14</p>
<p>NOTE - Total provisions of 290 million guilders related to Focus 2000 transformation programme include provision of 70 million guilders for software adjustments related to year 2000.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
